WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.526 --> 00:00:15.847
watched the royal police come through the gate.

2
00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:23.792
Mok puffed out his chest.

3
00:00:23.812 --> 00:00:26.193
"We can beat these guys!"

4
00:00:26.213 --> 00:00:31.776
"If we make a scene, the town gates will close," Gildong said.

5
00:00:33.312 --> 00:00:35.874
"Everyone split up and get back to the hideout quickly.

6
00:00:36.815 --> 00:00:38.176
I'll distract the royal police."

7
00:00:39.557 --> 00:00:41.778
"As you say, boss," Mok said.

8
00:00:48.403 --> 00:00:50.165
The police headed toward the jail.

9
00:00:54.468 --> 00:00:55.769
Gildong followed them.

10
00:01:01.752 --> 00:01:03.313
"You let those prisoners go?"

11
00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:06.195
Police Chief Heup roared at the guard.

12
00:01:06.215 --> 00:01:08.796
"The governor gave the order."

13
00:01:09.437 --> 00:01:10.457
The guard shrugged.

14
00:01:10.477 --> 00:01:12.599
"A messenger had a scroll."

15
00:01:12.619 --> 00:01:15.961
"You fool," the chief said.

16
00:01:15.981 --> 00:01:18.922
"The Hwalbindang tricked you so easily!

17
00:01:20.623 --> 00:01:21.444
I'll capture them."

18
00:01:31.832 --> 00:01:34.154
Gildong followed the police out of town.

19
00:01:39.997 --> 00:01:42.799
When they got to the mountain, he opened his fan.

20
00:01:42.819 --> 00:01:53.586
"Illusion." Heup led his men up a road.

21
00:01:54.427 --> 00:01:55.908
They traveled for hours.

22
00:02:05.232 --> 00:02:07.533
At last he saw an inn.

23
00:02:07.553 --> 00:02:10.594
"We'll stop and rest," he said.

24
00:02:13.835 --> 00:02:15.095
The soldiers ate dinner.

25
00:02:17.135 --> 00:02:19.036
Meanwhile a boy came in.

26
00:02:20.296 --> 00:02:21.657
He sat next to Heup.

27
00:02:21.677 --> 00:02:25.038
"Are you looking for Hong Gildong?"

28
00:02:25.498 --> 00:02:26.418
the boy whispered.

29
00:02:29.079 --> 00:02:29.879
Heup nodded.

30
00:02:29.899 --> 00:02:32.620
"Do you know where the Hwalbindang hideout is?"

31
00:02:34.188 --> 00:02:35.950
"Of course," the boy said.

32
00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:39.633
"In fact, I've been looking for a strong man like you.

33
00:02:40.374 --> 00:02:42.155
You can help me capture Hong Gildong.

34
00:02:44.117 --> 00:02:44.658
Follow me."

35
00:02:45.579 --> 00:02:46.980
Heup looked around the inn.

36
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.122
"What about my men?"

37
00:02:50.263 --> 00:02:51.264
The boy frowned.

38
00:02:51.284 --> 00:02:54.187
"You look strong, but your men don't.

39
00:02:55.788 --> 00:02:57.309
Hong Gildong is really powerful.

40
00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:59.692
It's safer if we go by ourselves."

41
00:03:05.452 --> 00:03:07.913
Heup and the boy went deep into the woods.

42
00:03:11.635 --> 00:03:13.676
close to the hideout," the boy said.

43
00:03:13.696 --> 00:03:18.438
"Great! I'll capture Hong Gildong for sure!"

44
00:03:19.398 --> 00:03:23.280
Heup grinned and glanced at the boy, but the boy was gone.

45
00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.581
"Police Chief!"

46
00:03:26.461 --> 00:03:27.442
a voice rang out.

47
00:03:27.462 --> 00:03:32.004
"Your search for Hong Gildong has angered the Heavens.

48
00:03:33.088 --> 00:03:36.090
You will go to the Land of Darkness to be judged."

49
00:03:39.653 --> 00:03:40.753
Heup looked around.

50
00:03:42.975 --> 00:03:44.056
The woods were empty.

51
00:03:46.757 --> 00:03:48.278
Where had the voice come from?

52
00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:52.081
He stood up tall.

53
00:03:52.101 --> 00:03:54.783
"Come out, whoever you are!

54
00:03:56.184 --> 00:03:57.325
I'm not afraid of you!

55
00:03:57.885 --> 00:04:00.947
I'm—" Suddenly everything went black.

56
00:04:02.624 --> 00:04:04.065
Heup was blindfolded!

57
00:04:04.085 --> 00:04:07.588
"Welcome to the Land of Darkness!"

58
00:04:08.149 --> 00:04:09.430
the voice boomed.

59
00:04:10.711 --> 00:04:12.032
Heup shook with fear.

60
00:04:12.052 --> 00:04:14.174
"Please let me go!

61
00:04:14.194 --> 00:04:16.556
I don't want to be dead!"

62
00:04:16.576 --> 00:04:19.918
"Ha-ha-ha." A boy laughed.

63
00:04:21.179 --> 00:04:22.681
The blindfold was removed.

64
00:04:24.942 --> 00:04:27.925
Heup saw the boy who had led him into the forest.

65
00:04:27.945 --> 00:04:31.528
"I told you Hong Gildong is powerful!"

66
00:04:31.944 --> 00:04:32.704
the boy said.

67
00:04:32.724 --> 00:04:37.366
"I should know because Heup gasped.

68
00:04:37.386 --> 00:04:39.547
"You're Hong Gildong!"

69
00:04:42.248 --> 00:04:45.049
"Yes." Gildong smiled.

70
00:04:45.069 --> 00:04:48.391
"I'm far more powerful than you.

71
00:04:50.011 --> 00:04:51.892
So don't bother trying to capture me!"
